                "text": "Regarding Medicare/Medicaid for illegals in OBBB:\n\nBecause of the Byrd Rule, the House\u2019s plan to cut the federal match for states giving Medicaid-like coverage to illegals didn\u2019t make it through.\n\nSo instead, the Senate added a new rule that restricts Medicaid access for non-citizens, with the exceptions of LPRs, Cuban-Haitian entrants, and COFA migrants.",
