                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "For far too long, PBMs have been at the center of why Americans pay so much for their prescriptions. Last Congress, we were finally ready to hold them accountable until Big Pharma lobbyists flooded D.C. to kill reform. I\u2019m not backing down. Patients come before profits. \n\nI\u2019m calling on @SpeakerJohnson and Republican leadership to bring PBM reform legislation to the House floor. Congress must have the courage to stand up to Big Pharma and deliver real transparency and lower costs for the American people.",
